WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:05.880
All of these people's feelings
are falling from the sky.

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:09.384
Violet.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.182
Major.

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:22.439
"To my beloved Major Gilbert.

00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:25.900
How are you?

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.528
I hope all is well with you.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.740
Where are you right now?

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:35.326
I hope you are not stressed out.

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:44.210
Spring, summer, autumn, and winter.

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:47.714
Many seasons have passed,

00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:52.343
but I am still waiting for your return.

00:00:54.345 --> 00:00:57.474
At first, I did not understand.

00:00:58.641 --> 00:01:02.145
I did not understand any of your feelings.

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:08.693
But I started learning about emotions,

00:01:09.277 --> 00:01:14.199
from this new life you have provided me.

00:01:16.326 --> 00:01:20.580
Through writing letters for others.
Through the people I have met.

00:01:26.169 --> 00:01:33.176
I still believe that you are still alive
out there somewhere.

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:40.767
That is why
I will continue to live my life.

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:46.815
I may not know what lies ahead,
but I will simply live.

00:01:50.151 --> 00:01:54.739
And if we should ever meet again,
this is what I would tell you.

00:01:56.366 --> 00:02:00.286
I now understand what the words...

00:02:10.004 --> 00:02:11.548
'I love you' mean."

